# WAYAMBA PLASTIC

## Multi-Factory Production & Inventory ERP – Technical Specification v1.0

SYSTEM SPECIFICATION

# WAYAMBA PLASTIC

Production · Inventory · Dispatch · Multi-Factory Management

Platform

Flutter + Supabase

Database

PostgreSQL

Factories

3+ locations

Users

6–10 accounts

Primary business operations

PP PalletsPP PelletsRaw MaterialsDay/Night ProductionCustomer DispatchInter-factory Transfers

This specification is the foundation I would give to a Flutter/Supabase development team. It defines the database, security, stock calculation rules, workflows and application screens.

One important business rule is established:

Production value will be calculated using the selling price, not production cost.

For example:

- Production: 1,500 kg
- Selling price: Rs. 310/kg
- Production value: Rs. 465,000

This is a production-at-selling-price reporting value. It must not be treated as actual sales revenue or inventory accounting cost. The system should keep these figures separate.

