 D --> E[Enter Product and Quantity]
 E --> F[Enter Selling Price]
 F --> G[Enter Material Consumption]
 G --> H[Submit Production]
 H --> I[Manager Review]
 I --> J{Approved?}
 J -->|Yes| K[Post Stock Movements]
 K --> L[Update Finished Stock]
 K --> M[Deduct Raw Material Stock]
 J -->|No| N[Return for Correction]
```

Production value:

$$
\text{Production Value}=\text{Quantity}\times\text{Selling Price}
$$

Selling prices should be copied into the production line when submitted. If the selling price changes next week, previous production records must retain their original price.

